--- stage: "type"
[
  TypeNode: [type Int String Dict: [fields: Any  open: Any  key-type: Any  value-type: Any]]
  Integer: TypeNode.Int
  String:  TypeNode.String
  Dict:    [TypeNode.Dict fields: []  open: 1  key-type: TypeNode.Top  value-type: TypeNode.Top]
]

---
# Minimal test: does calling a variadic builtin produce the error?
[
  result: [builtin-narrow %cwd "tests/corpus"]
]

[
  [%stderr.write "done\n" %stderr]
]
